WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:16.308
The very next day, Tommy went to Dr.

2
00:00:16.369 --> 00:00:17.249
Dolittle's house.

3
00:00:17.889 --> 00:00:19.831
Of course, the doctor wasn't home.

4
00:00:20.811 --> 00:00:23.593
But Tommy got to meet a very friendly dog.

5
00:00:24.874 --> 00:00:27.075
For a week, Tommy went to Dr.

6
00:00:27.115 --> 00:00:28.616
Dolittle's house every day.

7
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:34.222
Every time he visited, though, he found that the doctor still had not returned.

8
00:00:34.242 --> 00:00:36.423
"When is he coming back?"

9
00:00:36.843 --> 00:00:37.944
Tommy asked the dog.

10
00:00:38.704 --> 00:00:40.745
The dog let out two short barks.

11
00:00:40.765 --> 00:00:47.928
"I wish I could understand animal language, too," sighed Tommy before he went home.

12
00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:51.729
The friendly dog's name was Jip.

13
00:00:52.390 --> 00:00:54.691
He liked Tommy the first time he saw him.

14
00:00:55.291 --> 00:00:57.352
He especially liked the treats he brought.

15
00:00:58.044 --> 00:01:00.566
That's why he didn't growl or bark at him.

16
00:01:00.586 --> 00:01:03.787
"Jip, you're supposed to be guarding the house!"

17
00:01:04.308 --> 00:01:06.609
Dab-Dab the duck scolded him one day.

18
00:01:06.629 --> 00:01:11.672
"I'm just taking a break," Jip replied sleepily.

19
00:01:12.512 --> 00:01:14.714
Dab-Dab swatted Jip with his broom.

20
00:01:14.734 --> 00:01:17.335
"Did that boy come again?"

21
00:01:17.755 --> 00:01:18.236
he asked.

22
00:01:19.036 --> 00:01:21.117
"Ouch!" Jip jumped up.

23
00:01:21.137 --> 00:01:22.658
"Yes, he did!"

24
00:01:22.678 --> 00:01:25.080
"I wonder what he wants?"

25
00:01:25.632 --> 00:01:27.834
Dab-Dab said as he swept the steps.

26
00:01:29.695 --> 00:01:32.177
Gub-Gub the pig came out munching on a cake.

27
00:01:32.197 --> 00:01:35.799
"You're dropping crumbs all over the steps!"

28
00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:37.540
Dab-Dab shouted.

29
00:01:38.361 --> 00:01:43.424
Gub-Gub tried to pick up his mess, but succeeded only in stepping on Jip's tail.

30
00:01:43.444 --> 00:01:48.448
"Oh!" Jip yelped and chased after the pig.

31
00:01:48.468 --> 00:01:50.909
"Jip! Gub-Gub!

32
00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:51.970
Stop it!"

33
00:01:52.791 --> 00:01:54.392
Dab-Dab shouted after them.

34
00:01:55.536 --> 00:01:58.537
Meanwhile, Tommy was getting worried about the squirrel.

35
00:01:59.277 --> 00:02:02.958
"It doesn't look good," he told Jip the next time he visited.

36
00:02:02.978 --> 00:02:05.539
"I hope the doctor comes home soon."

37
00:02:06.839 --> 00:02:07.499
Jip barked.

38
00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:11.760
Just then Tommy heard a low rumbling sound.

39
00:02:12.281 --> 00:02:13.661
He looked up at the sky.

40
00:02:13.681 --> 00:02:17.282
"It looks like a big storm.

41
00:02:17.942 --> 00:02:19.823
I'd better get home," he said.

42
00:02:20.583 --> 00:02:24.344
Suddenly Jip sniffed the air and began barking excitedly.

43
00:02:24.984 --> 00:02:25.865
"What is it, boy?"

44
00:02:26.345 --> 00:02:27.526
Tommy looked around.

45
00:02:28.007 --> 00:02:29.708
But he could not see anything.

46
00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:33.351
Tommy ran down the path.

47
00:02:34.072 --> 00:02:37.955
Just as he turned onto the road, a heavy rain started to fall.

48
00:02:38.576 --> 00:02:41.418
He covered his head and ran as fast as he could.

49
00:02:42.279 --> 00:02:44.480
He didn't see the man walking toward him.

50
00:02:48.984 --> 00:02:50.345
Aw! Ouch!"

51
00:02:51.006 --> 00:02:53.248
they exclaimed as they crashed into each other.

52
00:02:54.012 --> 00:02:55.452
"I'm terribly sorry, sir!"

53
00:02:56.033 --> 00:02:58.353
Tommy shouted over the sounds of the storm.

54
00:02:58.373 --> 00:03:03.695
"I'm the one who should be sorry," the man said, chuckling.

55
00:03:04.255 --> 00:03:05.315
Tommy was amazed.

56
00:03:06.115 --> 00:03:08.896
No adult had ever been so kind to him before.

57
00:03:08.916 --> 00:03:11.877
"Do you live far from here?"

58
00:03:12.317 --> 00:03:13.097
the man yelled.

59
00:03:13.117 --> 00:03:15.358
"Yes, sir," Tommy answered.

60
00:03:16.158 --> 00:03:18.759
"Then come to my house and wait till the storm stops."

61
00:03:19.279 --> 00:03:20.679
The man began walking.

62
00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:22.400
Tommy followed him.

63
00:03:23.048 --> 00:03:27.209
But in the heavy wind and rain, it was hard to see where they were going.

64
00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:32.551
They arrived at a gate and walked up to the man's house.

65
00:03:34.171 --> 00:03:35.872
"What a storm!"

66
00:03:36.452 --> 00:03:37.172
the man said.

67
00:03:37.692 --> 00:03:40.313
He had very kind eyes and a kind smile.

68
00:03:41.153 --> 00:03:42.754
Tommy liked him immediately.

69
00:03:42.774 --> 00:03:46.015
"That's odd.

70
00:03:46.415 --> 00:03:47.555
Where is everyone?"

71
00:03:48.035 --> 00:03:50.156
the man said after he opened the door.

72
00:03:51.068 --> 00:03:55.329
Suddenly the room was filled with bright lights and loud barnyard noises.

73
00:03:56.069 --> 00:03:57.610
Tommy hid behind the man.

74
00:03:57.630 --> 00:03:59.910
"Oh, how delightful!

75
00:04:00.371 --> 00:04:01.731
Oh, wonderful!"

76
00:04:02.231 --> 00:04:04.472
the man said and clapped excitedly.

77
00:04:06.032 --> 00:04:07.832
Tommy could not believe his eyes.

78
00:04:08.413 --> 00:04:10.893
Surrounding him were all kinds of animals.

79
00:04:11.373 --> 00:04:16.815
They snorted, quacked, barked, hooted, squeaked, and chirped happily at the man.

80
00:04:17.535 --> 00:04:20.736
But more amazingly, the man answered them back.

81
00:04:22.132 --> 00:04:24.754
Tommy recognized the dog he saw every day.

82
00:04:25.314 --> 00:04:29.077
Suddenly he realized they were at the famous doctor's house!

83
00:04:29.777 --> 00:04:33.880
Meanwhile, the man was talking to the dog in strange barking sounds.

84
00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:38.563
What he was really saying was: "Do you know this boy, Jip?"

85
00:04:38.583 --> 00:04:40.144
"Yes, doctor!

86
00:04:40.524 --> 00:04:43.667
He came every day to wait for you," Jip replied.

87
00:04:43.687 --> 00:04:45.328
"How do you do?"

88
00:04:45.808 --> 00:04:47.409
the man shook Tommy's hand.

89
00:04:47.429 --> 00:04:48.570
"I'm Dr.

90
00:04:48.710 --> 00:04:51.091
Dolittle." Tommy was speechless.
